title: Nutanix Prism: VM state (API v4)
agents: nutanix
catalog: virtual/nutanix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the status of the VM's defined in a Nutanix cluster.
 The desired VM state can be configured through wato.

 This check requires the Nutanix Prism special agent for API v4 (agent_prism_v4).

item:
 The name of the VM.

discovery:
 One service is created for each VM.
